<BaseLayout seo={{title:'Contact — GAME//BRIEF',description:'Get in touch with the GAME//BRIEF team for tips, corrections, partnerships or advertising.',path:'/contact'}}><section class="container max-w-3xl py-10"><p class="kicker">Trust</p><h1 class="text-5xl font-black">Contact</h1><div class="prose-gb mt-6"><p>We'd like to hear from you — whether it's a story tip, a correction, a partnership idea or a general question about GAME//BRIEF.</p><h2>Email</h2><p>The fastest way to reach us is by email: <a href="mailto:officialbeyondsense@gmail.com">officialbeyondsense@gmail.com</a>. This inbox is monitored directly by our team, including site owner activex.</p><h2>What to include</h2><ul><li><strong>News tips:</strong> links, sources, and why it matters.</li><li><strong>Corrections:</strong> the article URL and what needs fixing.</li><li><strong>Advertising:</strong> your brand, goals and timeline — see our <a href="/advertise">Advertise</a> page for more.</li><li><strong>Everything else:</strong> just tell us what's on your mind.</li></ul><p>We read every message and try to reply as quickly as we can, though response times may vary during busy release weeks.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
